    description: "Add I/O primitive catalogs for Rust (std::fs, std::net, std::process), JavaScript/TypeScript (fs, net, http, child_process), C (fopen, socket, fork, exec), Go (os, net, io, exec), Java (java.io, java.net, ProcessBuilder). Integrate with existing FFI linkers (pyffi, cgo, jni, napi, wasm_bindgen) so boundary chains cross language boundaries. Test on a polyglot project. See ADR-0016 §Implementation Phase 2."  # df19
